## Mined correction (2026-09-01, Heron Gate 05 hazard doc)

### Anthropomorphized abstractions (kill on sight)

Do not give a non-agent wants, needs, desires, or intent. A check, a document, a schema, a metric, a
system, or a concept like "reproducibility" does not "want everything recorded," "need," "ask for,"
"care about," or "be hungry for" anything. Name the real actor, or state the requirement plainly:
